00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.010
I made a movie called "Orange County"

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.302
and then I was on one
episode of "The OC," yes.

00:01:11.302 --> 00:01:13.694
- You're really into
Orange County. (laughs)

00:01:13.694 --> 00:01:16.055
(audience laughing)
You're really into "The OC."

00:01:16.055 --> 00:01:17.188
I like it, I like it.

00:01:17.188 --> 00:01:19.049
I love that she's like, "I'm
gonna casually drop that."

00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:20.764
(Colin and Lucy laughing)

00:01:20.764 --> 00:01:24.110
Other than that, "Sabrina the
Teenage Witch" was a big one.

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:27.630
The movie, "My Girl" was
probably the reason why I'm...

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:29.748
