00:01:29.748 --> 00:01:31.120
(audience applauding)

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:34.850
The mom sang it. And
he's allergic to bees.

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:36.680
And he can't see without
his glasses, he kept saying,

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.670
oh my God.
- That scene.

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:41.180
And also watching that
girl who was, I think,

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.100
10 at the time and I was watching it.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:48.100
So seeing that emotional
range and be that capable

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.910
at that age was, I think, the insight into

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.150
maybe you can do this this young.

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:54.860
So I used to watch that
scene, the bee scene,

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:58.129
go out to the bathroom mirror,
and act through the scene.

00:01:58.129 --> 00:02:00.654
And be like...
(audience laughing)

00:02:00.654 --> 00:02:01.500
