00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.918
I would watch an award show
and I'd see someone sing

00:02:03.918 --> 00:02:04.751
and I'd be like, "Okay, okay."

00:02:04.751 --> 00:02:06.650
And I'd go to my room and
then hair brush it up.

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:10.136
And I'd kill it. I killed
it of my teddy bears.

00:02:10.136 --> 00:02:12.297
(audience applauding)
(Kelly laughing)

