00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.160
I mean a lot of people have
been, but have you met him?

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.040
- Oh, to this day I'm in love with him.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.577
- [Kelly] He has no idea.

00:02:19.577 --> 00:02:20.490
