admitting this on television.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.977
- Whatever.
(audience laughing)

00:02:21.977 --> 00:02:25.008
Whatever! Who doesn't love Paul McCartney?

00:02:25.008 --> 00:02:26.095
(audience cheering)
I'm just saying.

00:02:26.095 --> 00:02:27.896
It's Paul McCartney.

00:02:27.896 --> 00:02:30.260
That's a good one. That's a solid crush.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.930
Have you ever met?

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:33.971
- I've been in the same room as him.

00:02:33.971 --> 00:02:34.804
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:34.804 --> 00:02:37.690
- I love that that's... (laughs)

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:41.420
