was with was meeting him

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:44.920
and I couldn't be yet another
person who goes up to him

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:48.696
and tells him what the
Beatles mean to them and him.

00:02:48.696 --> 00:02:49.709
- [Kelly] I hate that feeling.

00:02:49.709 --> 00:02:51.770
- I couldn't, so I just
saw him across the room

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:54.580
