- I felt it was more intimate.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.310
- That's better. That's
the wink and the nod.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.012
That means you're in the club.
(audience laughing)

00:03:07.012 --> 00:03:09.874
- I think so. Even if he doesn't
know that I'm in the club.

00:03:09.874 --> 00:03:13.450
- You literally invited him
to the club and now it's...

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:16.360
