- Exactly.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:18.552
And this intimate head nod exchange.

00:03:18.552 --> 00:03:19.752
(audience laughing)

00:03:19.752 --> 00:03:21.802
Did you have anyone like that growing up?

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:25.474
- Yeah, I'm sure I did.

00:03:25.474 --> 00:03:26.472
- [Kelly] You don't remember?

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:27.493
- I don't really remember.

00:03:27.493 --> 00:03:28.630
- [Kelly] You don't wanna say it!

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.072
- [Colin] I don't wanna say.

00:03:30.072 --> 00:03:31.160
- You don't wanna say it! (laughs)

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:33.813
- I don't wanna say it.
- I'll say mine.

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:36.370
I had several that I thought were cute,

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:37.813
but I love Steven Tyler.

00:03:38.873 --> 00:03:41.213
That "caw caw caw caw," I
