00:03:45.947 --> 00:03:47.142
- [Lucy] That's what got you?

00:03:47.142 --> 00:03:49.620
- Yeah, and the music. I was
real hardcore into that music.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.060
- Can I get the "caw caw
caw caw" one more time?

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:54.790
