one time we did a shoot.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.480
It was like peak artists
and then their idols,

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.843
people they love and they
knew I loved Steven Tyler,

00:03:58.843 --> 00:04:00.086
so they were like, "Will
you do this shoot?"

00:04:00.086 --> 00:04:01.200
And then I'm like, "Yes."

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.410
And I hate photo shoots,
so when I say yes,

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.984
I really wanna be there.
(audience laughing)

00:04:04.984 --> 00:04:08.410
And I showed up but it was
so funny 'cause he is very,

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:12.262
