00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:02.063
- I know, but that's the
creepiest cover of any,

00:05:02.919 --> 00:05:05.259
I just love that someone,
I saw this and I was like,

00:05:05.259 --> 00:05:08.523
"Someone was like, 'This is
gonna help this book sell.'"

00:05:08.523 --> 00:05:09.930
(audience laughing)
That creeped me out.

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:10.763
- [Lucy] They nailed it.

00:05:10.763 --> 00:05:13.140
- Do you even want that guy
