00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.190
I'm still thinking about it.
(Colin laughing)

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.220
I'm just saying. So
tell me about the show.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.059
Other than the cover. (laughs)

00:05:19.059 --> 00:05:20.410
- At least it's an impactful
gift. It resonates.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:23.070
- It did, it stuck with me,
didn't it? I'm terrified.

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.310
- Our cover is slightly less traumatizing.

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:26.780
- [Kelly] Thank you for that. (laughs)

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:27.613
- Your welcome.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:31.410
So it follows Bobby Jones,
played by Will Poulter,

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.090
and he stumbles across a dying man

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:36.410
who utters his last words,
"Why didn't they ask Evans?"

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:38.640
And then meanwhile, my character Frankie

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.890
rolls back into town and cajoles him to go

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:43.240
on this adventure to get to
the bottom of this mystery.

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.890
And it's adapted and
directed by Hugh Laurie.

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:50.460
So to add his comedic timing to that,

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:52.560
it was such a privilege.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:54.610
It was such a fun one.
- That's so cool.

